msgstr ""
"Ytterligare alternativ för <a "
"href=\"https://www.smartmontools.org/browser/trunk/smartmontools/smartctl.8."
"in\" target=\"_blank\">smartctl(8)</a>."

msgid "Additional Data VDevs to Create"
msgstr "Ytterligare data-VDEV:er att skapa"

msgid "Additional Domains"
msgstr "Ytterligare domäner"

msgid "Additional Hardware"
msgstr "Ytterligare maskinvara"

msgid ""
"Additional Kerberos application settings. See the \"appdefaults\" section "
"of <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=krb5.conf&apropos=0&"
"sektion=5&manpath=FreeBSD+12.0-RELEASE&arch=default&format=html\" "
"target=\"_blank\">[krb.conf(5)]</a>. for available settings and usage "
"syntax."
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare Kerberos-programinställningar. Se avsnittet \"appdefaults\" i "
"<a href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=krb5.conf&apropos=0&"
"sektion=5&manpath=FreeBSD+12.0-RELEASE&arch=default&format=html\" "
"target=\"_blank\">[krb.conf(5)]</a> för tillgängliga inställningar och "
"användningssyntax."

msgid ""
"Additional Kerberos library settings. See the \"libdefaults\" section of <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=krb5.conf&apropos=0&"
"sektion=5&manpath=FreeBSD+12.0-RELEASE&arch=default&format=html\" "
"target=\"_blank\">[krb.conf(5)]</a>. for available settings and usage "
"syntax."
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare Kerberos-biblioteksinställningar. Se avsnittet \"libdefaults\" "
"i <a href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=krb5.conf&apropos=0&"
"sektion=5&manpath=FreeBSD+12.0-RELEASE&arch=default&format=html\" "
"target=\"_blank\">[krb.conf(5)]</a> för tillgängliga inställningar och "
"användningssyntax."

msgid "Additional Parameters"
msgstr "Ytterligare parametrar"

msgid ""
"Additional domains to search. Separate entries by  pressing "
"<code>Enter</code>. Adding search domains can cause slow DNS  lookups."
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare domäner att söka i. Separera poster genom att trycka på "
"<code>Retur</code>. Sökdomäner kan göra DNS-uppslag långsamma."

msgid ""
"Additional hosts to be appended to <i>/etc/hosts</i>. Separate entries by "
"pressing <code>Enter</code>. Hosts defined here are  still accessible by "
"name even when DNS is not available. See  <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=hosts\" "
"target=\"_blank\">hosts(5)</a>  for additional information."
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare värdar att lägga till i <i>/etc/hosts</i>. Separera poster genom "
"att trycka på <code>Retur</code>. Värdar som definieras här kan fortfarande "
"nås med namn när DNS inte är tillgängligt. Se <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=hosts\" "
"target=\"_blank\">hosts(5)</a> för mer information."

msgid ""
"Additional options for <a "
"href=\"https://arthurdejong.org/nss-pam-ldapd/nslcd.conf.5\" "
"target=\"_blank\">nslcd.conf</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare alternativ för <a "
"href=\"https://arthurdejong.org/nss-pam-ldapd/nslcd.conf.5\" "
"target=\"_blank\">nslcd.conf</a>."

msgid ""
"Additional parameters from <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=ifconfig\" "
"target=\"_blank\">ifconfig(8)</a>."
msgstr ""
"Ytterligare parametrar från <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=ifconfig\" "
"target=\"_blank\">ifconfig(8)</a>."

msgid "Additional parameters."
msgstr "Ytterligare parametrar."

msgid "Address"
msgstr "Adress"

msgid "Address space limit in bytes for the jail."
msgstr "Gräns för adressutrymme i byte för jail-miljön."

msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "Adresser"

msgid ""
"Adjust how often alert notifications are sent, use  the Frequency "
"drop-down. Setting the Frequency to NEVER prevents that  alert from being "
"added to alert notifications, but the alert can still  show in the web "
"interface if it is triggered."
msgstr ""
"Justera hur ofta larmaviseringar skickas med rullgardinsmenyn Frekvens. Om "
"frekvensen sätts till ALDRIG läggs larmet inte till i larmaviseringar, men "
"det kan fortfarande visas i webbgränssnittet när det utlöses."

msgid "Adjust the file permissions using the checkboxes."
msgstr "Justera filbehörigheterna med kryssrutorna."

msgid "Admin Portals"
msgstr "Administratörsportaler"

msgid "Admin Server"
msgstr "Administrationsserver"

msgid ""
"Administrative account name on the LDAP server. Example: "
"<i>cn=Manager,dc=test,dc=org</i>."
msgstr ""
"Administrativt kontonamn på LDAP-servern. Exempel: "
"<i>cn=Manager,dc=test,dc=org</i>."

msgid "Administrator Password"
msgstr "Administratörslösenord"

msgid "Administrator password"
msgstr "Administratörslösenord"

msgid "Administrators Group"
msgstr "Administratörsgrupp"

msgid "Adv. Power Management"
msgstr "Avancerad strömhantering"

msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avancerat"

msgid "Advanced Details"
msgstr "Avancerad information"

msgid "Advanced Jail Creation"
msgstr "Avancerat skapande av jail-miljö"

msgid "Advanced Mode"
msgstr "Avancerat läge"

msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Avancerade alternativ"

msgid "Advanced Plugin Installation"
msgstr "Avancerad installation av insticksprogram"

msgid "Advanced Power Management"
msgstr "Avancerad strömhantering"

msgid "Advanced Remote Options"
msgstr "Avancerade fjärralternativ"

msgid "Advanced Replication Creation"
msgstr "Avancerat skapande av replikering"

msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Avancerade inställningar"

msgid ""
"After entering the <b>Hostname, Username</b>, and <b>Password</b>, click "
"<b>Fetch Datastores</b> and select the datastore to be synchronized."
msgstr ""
"När du har angett <b>värdnamn, användarnamn</b> och <b>lösenord</b> klickar "
"du på <b>Hämta datalager</b> och väljer datalagret som ska synkroniseras."

msgid "Alarms"
msgstr "Larm"

msgid "Alert"
msgstr "Larm"

msgid "Alert Services"
msgstr "Larmtjänster"

msgid "Alert Settings"
msgstr "Larminställningar"

msgid "Alerts"
msgstr "Larm"

msgid "Algorithm"
msgstr "Algoritm"

msgid ""
"Alias for the identical interface  on the other TrueNAS controller. The "
"alias can be an IPv4 or IPv6 address."
msgstr ""
"Alias för det identiska gränssnittet på den andra TrueNAS-styrenheten. "
"Aliaset kan vara en IPv4- eller IPv6-adress."

msgid "Aliases"
msgstr "Alias"

msgid "Aliases must be 15 characters or less."
msgstr "Alias får innehålla högst 15 tecken."

msgid "All Disks"
msgstr "Alla diskar"

msgid ""
"All built-in groups are  hidden by default. Use the gear icon (top-right) "
"to toggle the display of built-in groups."
msgstr ""
"Alla inbyggda grupper är dolda som standard. Använd kugghjulsikonen uppe "
"till höger för att växla visning av inbyggda grupper."

msgid ""
"All built-in users except <i>root</i> are  hidden by default. Use the gear "
"icon (top-right) to toggle the display of built-in users."
msgstr ""
"Alla inbyggda användare utom <i>root</i> är dolda som standard. Använd "
"kugghjulsikonen uppe till höger för att växla visning av inbyggda användare."

msgid ""
"All data stored in this dataset will be decrypted and the dataset marked  "
"as non-encrypted. Do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Alla data som lagras i denna datamängd dekrypteras och datamängden markeras "
"som okrypterad. Vill du fortsätta?"

msgid "All dirs"
msgstr "Alla kataloger"

msgid "All passwords, keys, secrets are encrypted and need this to be decrypted"
msgstr "Alla lösenord, nycklar och hemligheter är krypterade och behöver detta för att dekrypteras"

msgid "All users"
msgstr "Alla användare"

msgid "Allocate RAM for the VM. Minimum value is 256 MiB."
msgstr "Tilldela RAM-minne till den virtuella datorn. Minsta värdet är 256 MiB."

msgid "Allocate a number of megabytes of RAM to the VM."
msgstr "Tilldela den virtuella datorn ett antal megabyte RAM-minne."

msgid "Allocate at least 256 MiB."
msgstr "Tilldela minst 256 MiB."

msgid "Allocate space for the new zvol."
msgstr "Tilldela utrymme för den nya zvolymen."

msgid "Allow"
msgstr "Tillåt"

msgid "Allow All Initiators"
msgstr "Tillåt alla initierare"

msgid "Allow Anonymous Binding"
msgstr "Tillåt anonym bindning"

msgid "Allow Anonymous Login"
msgstr "Tillåt anonym inloggning"

msgid "Allow Blocks Larger than 128KB"
msgstr "Tillåt block större än 128 KB"

msgid "Allow Compressed WRITE Records"
msgstr "Tillåt komprimerade WRITE-poster"

msgid "Allow DNS updates"
msgstr "Tillåt DNS-uppdateringar"

msgid "Allow Duplicate GIDs"
msgstr "Tillåt dubbletta GID:er"

msgid "Allow Guest Access"
msgstr "Tillåt gäståtkomst"

msgid "Allow Hosts"
msgstr "Tillåt värdar"

msgid "Allow Kerberos Authentication"
msgstr "Tillåt Kerberos-autentisering"

msgid "Allow List"
msgstr "Tillåtelselista"

msgid "Allow Local User Login"
msgstr "Tillåt lokal användarinloggning"

msgid "Allow New Files"
msgstr "Tillåt nya filer"

msgid "Allow Password Authentication"
msgstr "Tillåt lösenordsautentisering"

msgid "Allow Root Login"
msgstr "Tillåt root-inloggning"

msgid "Allow TCP Port Forwarding"
msgstr "Tillåt vidarebefordran av TCP-portar"

msgid "Allow Taking Empty Snapshots"
msgstr "Tillåt skapande av tomma ögonblicksbilder"

msgid "Allow Transfer Resumption"
msgstr "Tillåt återupptagande av överföring"

msgid "Allow Trusted Domains"
msgstr "Tillåt betrodda domäner"

msgid ""
"Allow anonymous FTP logins with access to the  directory specified in "
"<b>Path</b>."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt anonyma FTP-inloggningar med åtkomst till katalogen som anges i "
"<b>sökvägen</b>."

msgid ""
"Allow any local user to log in. By default, only  members of the <i>ftp</i> "
"group are allowed to log in."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt alla lokala användare att logga in. Som standard får endast medlemmar "
"i gruppen <i>ftp</i> logga in."

msgid ""
"Allow configuring a non-standard port to access the GUI over <i>HTTP</i>. "
"Changing this setting might require changing a <a "
"href=\"https://www.redbrick.dcu.ie/~d_fens/articles/Firefox:_This_Address_"
"is_Restricted\" target=\"_blank\">Firefox configuration setting</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt konfigurering av en icke-standardport för åtkomst till "
"webbgränssnittet via <i>HTTP</i>. Om inställningen ändras kan även en <a "
"href=\"https://www.redbrick.dcu.ie/~d_fens/articles/Firefox:_This_Address_"
"is_Restricted\" target=\"_blank\">Firefox-inställning</a> behöva ändras."

msgid "Allow configuring a non-standard port to access the GUI over <i>HTTPS</i>."
msgstr "Tillåt konfigurering av en icke-standardport för åtkomst till gränssnittet via <i>HTTPS</i>."

msgid ""
"Allow different groups to be configured with different authentication "
"profiles. Example: all users with a group ID of <i>1</i> will inherit the "
"authentication profile associated with Group <i>1</i>."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt att olika grupper konfigureras med olika autentiseringsprofiler. "
"Exempel: alla användare med grupp-ID <i>1</i> ärver autentiseringsprofilen "
"som är kopplad till grupp <i>1</i>."

msgid ""
"Allow encrypted connections. Requires a certificate  created or imported "
"with the <b>System > Certificates</b> menu."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt krypterade anslutningar. Kräver ett certifikat som har skapats eller "
"importerats via menyn <b>System > Certifikat</b>."

msgid "Allow from"
msgstr "Tillåt från"

msgid ""
"Allow group members to use <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=sudo&manpath=FreeBSD+11.1-"
"RELEASE+and+Ports\" target=\"_blank\">sudo</a>. Group members are prompted "
"for their password when using <b>sudo</b>."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt gruppmedlemmar att använda <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=sudo&manpath=FreeBSD+11.1-"
"RELEASE+and+Ports\" target=\"_blank\">sudo</a>. Gruppmedlemmar uppmanas "
"att ange sitt lösenord när de använder <b>sudo</b>."

msgid ""
"Allow hostnames or IP addresses to connect to the  share. Click <i>ADD</i> "
"to add multiple entries. <br><br>  If neither *Allow Hosts* or *Deny Hosts* "
"contains  an entry, then AFP share access is allowed for any host. <br><br> "
" If there is a *Allow Hosts* list but no *Deny Hosts* list, then only allow "
" hosts on the *Allow Hosts* list. <br><br>  If there is a *Deny Hosts* list "
"but no *Allow Hosts* list, then allow all  hosts that are not on the *Deny "
"Hosts* list. <br><br>  If there is both a *Allow Hosts* and *Deny Hosts* "
"list, then allow all hosts  that are on the *Allow Hosts* list. <br><br>  "
"If there is a host not on the *Allow Hosts* and not on the *Deny Hosts* "
"list,  then allow it."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Allow more ciphers for  <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=sshd\" "
"target=\"_blank\">sshd(8)</a>  in addition to the defaults in  <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=sshd_config\" "
"target=\"_blank\">sshd_config(5)</a>.  <code>None</code> allows unencrypted "
"SSH connections and  <code>AES128-CBC</code> allows the 128-bit  <a "
"href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/FIPS/NIST.FIPS.197.pdf\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Advanced Encryption Standard</a>.<br><br>  WARNING: these "
"ciphers are considered security vulnerabilities and  should only be allowed "
"in a secure network environment."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt fler chiffersviter för  <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=sshd\" "
"target=\"_blank\">sshd(8)</a>  utöver standardinställningarna i  <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=sshd_config\" "
"target=\"_blank\">sshd_config(5)</a>.  <code>None</code> tillåter "
"okrypterade SSH-anslutningar och  <code>AES128-CBC</code> tillåter den "
"128-bitars  <a "
"href=\"https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/FIPS/NIST.FIPS.197.pdf\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Advanced Encryption Standard</a>.<br><br>  VARNING: "
"dessa chiffersviter anses vara säkerhetssårbarheter och  bör endast tillåtas "
"i en säker nätverksmiljö."

msgid "Allow non-root mount"
msgstr "Tillåt montering som icke-root"

msgid ""
"Allow or deny access to SYSV IPC message primitives. <br><b>Inherit</b>: "
"All IPC objects on the system are visible to the jail.<br> <b>New</b>: Only "
"objects the jail creates using the private key namespace are visible. The "
"system and parent jails have access to the jail objects but <i>not</i> "
"private keys.<br> <b>Disable</b>: The jail cannot perform any "
"<b>sysvmsg</b> related system calls."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Allow or deny access to SYSV IPC semaphore primitives.<br> <b>Inherit</b>: "
"All IPC objects on the system are visible to the jail.<br> <b>New</b>: Only "
"objects the jail creates using the private key namespace are visible. The "
"system and parent jails have access to the jail objects but <i>not</i> "
"private keys. <br> <b>Disable</b>: The jail cannot perform any "
"<b>sysvmem</b> related system calls."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Allow or deny access to SYSV IPC shared memory primitives.<br> "
"<b>Inherit</b>: All IPC objects on the system are visible to the jail.<br> "
"<b>New</b>: Only objects the jail creates using the private key namespace "
"are visible. The system and parent jails have access to the jail objects "
"but <i>not</i> private keys.<br> <b>Disable</b>: The jail cannot perform "
"any <b>sysvshm</b> related system calls."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Allow the jail hostname to be changed with <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=hostname\" "
"target=\"_blank\">hostname(1)</a> or <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=sethostname\" "
"target=\"_blank\">sethostname(3)</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt att jail-miljöns värdnamn ändras med <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=hostname\" "
"target=\"_blank\">hostname(1)</a> eller <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=sethostname\" "
"target=\"_blank\">sethostname(3)</a>."

msgid ""
"Allow the jail to access the bhyve virtual machine monitor (VMM). The jail "
"must have FreeBSD 12.0 or newer installed with the <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=vmm\" "
"target=\"_blank\">vmm(4)</a> kernel module loaded."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Allow this replication to send large data blocks. The  destination system "
"must also support large blocks. This setting cannot be changed  after it "
"has been enabled and the replication task is created. For more details, see "
" <a href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=zfs\"  "
"target=\"_blank\">zfs(8)</a>."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt att denna replikering skickar stora datablock. Målsystemet måste också "
"stödja stora block. Inställningen kan inte ändras när den har aktiverats och "
"replikeringsuppgiften har skapats. Mer information finns i <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=zfs\" "
"target=\"_blank\">zfs(8)</a>."

msgid ""
"Allow using open file handles that can withstand short disconnections.  "
"Support for POSIX byte-range locks in Samba is also disabled. This option "
"is not recommended when  configuring multi-protocol or local access to "
"files."
msgstr ""
"Tillåt öppna filhandtag som klarar korta frånkopplingar. Stöd för POSIX-"
"byteintervallås i Samba inaktiveras också. Alternativet rekommenderas inte "
"vid konfiguration av flerprotokolls- eller lokal filåtkomst."

msgid "Allowed Initiators (IQN)"
msgstr "Tillåtna initierare (IQN)"

msgid "Allowed characters: letters, numbers, underscore (_), and dash (-)."
msgstr "Tillåtna tecken: bokstäver, siffror, understreck (_) och bindestreck (-)."

msgid ""
"Allows multiple  <a href=\"http://www.ntfs.com/ntfs-multiple.htm\" "
"target\"_blank\">NTFS data streams</a>.  Disabling this option causes MacOS "
"to write streams to files on the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"Tillåter flera <a href=\"http://www.ntfs.com/ntfs-multiple.htm\" "
"target\"_blank\">NTFS-dataströmmar</a>. Om alternativet inaktiveras "
"skriver macOS strömmar till filer i filsystemet."

msgid ""
"Allows the drive to enter standby, even when non-physical S.M.A.R.T.  "
"operations could prevent the drive from sleeping."
msgstr ""
"Tillåter att disken går in i vänteläge även när icke-fysiska S.M.A.R.T.-"
"åtgärder annars kan hindra disken från att vila."

msgid ""
"Allows the share to host user home  directories. Each user is given a "
"personal home directory when  connecting to the share which is not "
"accessible by other users. This  allows for a personal, dynamic share. Only "
"one share can be used  as the home share."
msgstr ""
"Tillåter att delningen är värd för användarnas hemkataloger. Varje användare "
"får en personlig hemkatalog vid anslutning till delningen, som andra "
"användare inte kan nå. Detta ger en personlig, dynamisk delning. Endast en "
"delning kan användas som hemdelning."

msgid ""
"Alphanumeric <a href=\"https://www.backblaze.com/b2/cloud-storage.html\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Backblaze B2</a> Application Key ID. To generate a new "
"application key, log in to the Backblaze account, go to the <i>App Keys</i> "
"page, and add a new application key. Copy the application <i>keyID</i> "
"string to this field."
msgstr ""
"Alfanumeriskt ID för <a href=\"https://www.backblaze.com/b2/cloud-storage.html\" "
"target=\"_blank\">Backblaze B2</a>-programnyckeln. Om du vill skapa en ny "
"programnyckel loggar du in på Backblaze-kontot, går till sidan <i>App Keys</i> "
"och lägger till en ny programnyckel. Kopiera strängen <i>keyID</i> till detta "
"fält."

msgid "Also Include Naming Schema"
msgstr "Inkludera även namnschema"

msgid "Also unlock any encrypted dataset stored within this dataset."
msgstr "Lås även upp alla krypterade datamängder som finns i denna datamängd."

msgid "Alt Background 1"
msgstr "Alternativ bakgrund 1"

msgid "Alt Background 2"
msgstr "Alternativ bakgrund 2"

msgid "Alt Foreground 1"
msgstr "Alternativ förgrund 1"

msgid "Alt Foreground 2"
msgstr "Alternativ förgrund 2"

msgid ""
"Alternative names that SMB clients can use when connecting to this NAS. Can "
"be no greater than 15 characters."
msgstr ""
"Alternativa namn som SMB-klienter kan använda för att ansluta till denna NAS. "
"De får inte vara längre än 15 tecken."

msgid "Always"
msgstr "Alltid"

msgid "Always Chroot"
msgstr "Alltid chroot"

msgid "Always On"
msgstr "Alltid på"

msgid ""
"Amazon Web Services Key ID. This is found on  <a "
"href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon AWS</a> by  going "
"through <i>My account -> Security Credentials -> Access Keys  (Access Key "
"ID and Secret Access Key)</i>. Must be alphanumeric and  between 5 and 20 "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Nyckel-ID för Amazon Web Services. Det finns på <a "
"href=\"https://aws.amazon.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Amazon AWS</a> via "
"<i>My account -> Security Credentials -> Access Keys (Access Key ID and "
"Secret Access Key)</i>. Värdet måste vara alfanumeriskt och mellan 5 och 20 "
"tecken långt."

msgid ""
"Amazon Web Services password. If the Secret Access Key cannot be  found or "
"remembered, go to <i>My Account -> Security Credentials ->  Access Keys</i> "
"and create a new key pair. Must be alphanumeric and  between 8 and 40 "
"characters."
msgstr ""
"Lösenord för Amazon Web Services. Om Secret Access Key inte kan hittas eller "
"kommas ihåg går du till <i>My Account -> Security Credentials -> Access "
"Keys</i> och skapar ett nytt nyckelpar. Värdet måste vara alfanumeriskt och "
"mellan 8 och 40 tecken långt."

msgid ""
"Amount of disk space that can be used by the selected groups.  Entering "
"<code>0</code> (zero) allows all disk space."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Amount of disk space that can be used by the selected users.  Entering "
"<code>0</code> (zero) allows all disk space to be used."
msgstr ""

msgid "Amount of locked memory in bytes for the jail."
msgstr "Mängd låst minne i byte för jail-miljön."

msgid ""
"An ACL is detected on the selected path but <i>Enable ACL</i> is not "
"selected for this share.  ACLs must be stripped from the dataset prior to "
"creating an SMB share."
msgstr ""
"En ACL upptäcktes på den valda sökvägen, men <i>Aktivera ACL</i> är inte "
"valt för denna delning. ACL:er måste rensas från datamängden innan en "
"SMB-delning skapas."

msgid "An ACL is present in this path"
msgstr "En ACL finns på denna sökväg"

msgid ""
"An IP address must be provided for each controller and the virtual "
"interface."
msgstr ""
"En IP-adress måste anges för varje styrenhet och det virtuella gränssnittet."

msgid "An update is already applied. Please reboot the system."
msgstr "En uppdatering har redan tillämpats. Starta om systemet."

msgid "Anonymous User Download Bandwidth"
msgstr "Nedladdningsbandbredd för anonym användare"

msgid "Anonymous User Upload Bandwidth"
msgstr "Uppladdningsbandbredd för anonym användare"

msgid "Another theme is using this label. Please enter a new label."
msgstr "Ett annat tema använder denna etikett. Ange en ny etikett."

msgid "Any notes about initiators."
msgstr "Eventuella anteckningar om initierare."

msgid "Appdefaults Auxiliary Parameters"
msgstr "Extra Appdefaults-parametrar"

msgid ""
"Append <i>@realm</i> to <i>cn</i> in LDAP queries for both groups and users "
"when User CN is set)."
msgstr ""

msgid "Append Data"
msgstr "Lägg till data"

msgid ""
"Appends a suffix to the share connection path.  This is used to provide "
"unique shares on a per-user, per-computer, or per-IP address basis.  "
"Suffixes can contain a macro. See the  <a "
"href=\"https://www.freebsd.org/cgi/man.cgi?query=smb.conf\" "
"target=\"_blank\">smb.conf</a> manual page for  a list of supported macros. "
"The connectpath <b>must</b> be preset before a client connects."
msgstr ""

msgid "Apple Shares (AFP)"
