"transfers:<br><br>  <i>PUSH:</i> Encrypt files before transfer and store "
"the encrypted  files on the remote system. Files are encrypted using the  "
"<b>Encryption Password</b> and <b>Encryption Salt</b> values.<br><br>  "
"<i>PULL:</i> Decrypt files that are being stored on the remote system  "
